  M4 CANDIDATE [D-talk-request gen_kextacj turns=11 naturalEnd=true]:
    NPC: "Don't mind me. I'm having a whole argument in my head and losing."
    NPC: "...I should say, I trade in what I know. My knowledge for yours. Or food, if you're short on secrets."
    NPC: "There's still the matter of the ambush of Catalina. Nobody's settled it."
    YOU: "What did you see out there?"
    NPC: "This one — Asian Persimmon. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now."
    YOU: "Teach me something from the wild."
    NPC: "This one is Goldenrod. Look at the leaf, feel the stem, breathe it in. It'll stick."
    YOU: "What places have you found out there?"
    NPC: "a cellar full of jars — trace it with your finger. That's where it is, and it's real."
    YOU: Go back to the site. Look at the ground.
    NPC: The ground remembers.
    YOU: "Who saw them leave?" (name the witnesses)
    NPC: No one saw Catalina leave. Just trees.
    YOU: Follow the food. Who bought whom? (investigate bribery)
    NPC: You follow the food, the gifts, the sudden friendliness. Nothing you can prove — yet. Dig again; the trail is still warm.
    YOU: Follow the food. Who bought whom? (investigate bribery)
    NPC: You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking.
    YOU: Follow the food. Who bought whom? (investigate bribery)
    NPC: You turn the gift-giving over, the favors, the timing. Innocent from every angle. It isn't — but you can't prove that yet.
    YOU: Follow the food. Who bought whom? (investigate bribery)
    NPC: Another pass over the same ground. Somebody's being careful. Careful people leave cleaner trails — and cleaner trails are still trails.
    YOU: Follow the food. Who bought whom? (investigate bribery)
    NPC: You ask around the edges — who was carrying what, who stopped meeting whose eyes. Everyone suddenly has somewhere to be.
    NPC: "We're done for now. Not done-done. For now."
    YOU: "..."
    NPC: They fill the quiet. "Anyway — where was I?"
    NPC: "See you around."

